{"module":"grammar","item":{"id":"b1-grammar-n-deklination","level":"B1","topic":"Nomen","title":{"de":"Die n-Deklination","bn":"N-declension: কিছু masculine noun-এর ending বদলায়"},"summary":"der Student → den Studenten, der Junge → dem Jungen।","intro":[{"kind":"text","text":"Topic 11-এ মূলত তিনটি জিনিস শিখবে: N-declension, noun-verb combinations এবং compound nouns।"}],"sections":[{"heading":"N-declension","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"কিছু masculine noun Akkusativ ও Dativ-এর মতো নির্দিষ্ট case-এ -n বা -en নেয়।"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Der Student lernt Deutsch.","en":"The student learns German.","bn":"ছাত্রটি জার্মান শেখে।"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"এখানে der Student হলো Nominativ।"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ich sehe den Studenten.","en":"I see the student.","bn":"আমি ছাত্রটিকে দেখি।"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"এখানে den Studenten হলো Akkusativ।"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ich helfe dem Jungen.","en":"I help the boy.","bn":"আমি ছেলেটিকে সাহায্য করি।"}]},{"kind":"text","text":"der Junge → dem Jungen।"},{"kind":"text","text":"এ ধরনের noun-এর কয়েকটি উদাহরণ: der Student, der Junge, der Kollege, der Mensch।"}]}],"part":1,"test":[{"id":"b1-grammar-n-deklination-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich sehe den ___. (der Student)","options":["Student","Studenten","Students"],"answer":1,"explanation":"N-declension: Akkusativ-এ -en: den Studenten।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-n-deklination-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich helfe dem ___. (der Junge)","options":["Junge","Jungen","Junges"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Dativ-এ -n: dem Jungen।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-n-deklination-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"Der ___ lernt Deutsch. (Nominativ)","options":["Student","Studenten","Studente"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Nominativ-এ ending বদলায় না: der Student।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-n-deklination-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"N-declension কোন noun-এ হয়?","options":["কিছু masculine noun-এ","সব feminine noun-এ","সব neuter noun-এ"],"answer":0,"explanation":"কিছু masculine noun।"},{"i